Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}赤色要塞第三关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}码头尽头停着一艘战舰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.05,0:00:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}六座炮塔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}得一座一座打掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}最后一座炸掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}整艘船起火下沉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}喜欢这种打法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}顺手点个赞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}这款是我几个复刻里玩的人最多的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}可它一直只有两关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}这次照着原版第三关的地图
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}把整个港口搭了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}第一版刚跑起来就闹了笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}地上的箭头全画成了字母 Y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}海水亮得像游泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}战舰的舰桥黑成一团
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}改完之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}才像个正经港口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}还顺手查出一个老问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}新玩家进场站着不动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}八秒就会被打死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}现在你不动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}敌人就先不开火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}屏幕上还会提示怎么开车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}回到关卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}两条栈桥并排伸进海里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}两边的炮艇夹着你打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}另一条桥上还有坦克堵路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.03,0:01:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}停车场里停着的吉普别放过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}炸开这一辆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}里面藏着一颗星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.59,0:01:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}最难的是仓库之间的之字通道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}炮台贴着墙排成一排
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}这一趟就在这儿被打翻了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}把十二个人全部送上直升机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}再炸开最后一道闸门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}就到码头了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}按 C 换成低位视角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}整个港口就立在你眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}第三关已经上线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}网页版电脑手机都能玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.35,0:01:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}入口在简介里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}原作一共六关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.87,0:01:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}下一关想先看哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,820)}评论里告诉我